BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  # The Parable of the River of Reflection) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of the River of Reflection. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    waters between them possessed sacred magic-any gift cast into the river would emerge on the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    far shore threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  One season, the First Village suffered drought. A young farmer named Orion stood at the water') Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    s edge, holding his family's last sack of grain-five measures that meant survival. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  "Trust the river," whispered the ancient ones. "Trust those across the water.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  Heart pounding, Orion cast three measures into the current. They swirled and multiplied, arriv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ing as nine measures on the far shore. The Second Village rejoiced at this abundance. Their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    elder, understanding the river's covenant, sent back six measures in gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  Orion's family thrived through winter. But more importantly, both villages learned the river's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (     truth: generosity multiplied returns greater abundance, while fear hoards only scarcity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  Each season thereafter, both villages stood at the banks. Sometimes they sent much, sometimes ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    little, but always they remembered-the river multiplies what is given, but only trust betwee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    n shores transforms multiplication into true prosperity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  The River of Reflection still flows, waiting for those brave enough to cast their gifts upon i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ts waters.) Tj ET
