BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ter into the valley below, the spring transformed it into three cups that nourished the wait) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ing gardens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  The gardeners who received this gift faced a choice: keep all three cups for themselves, or re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    turn some water to the mountain's reservoir, ensuring Aster could pour again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  The first gardener, fearful of scarcity, kept everything. The spring ran dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  The second gardener returned exactly one cup-fair, they thought. But the spring flowed weakly,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (     barely maintaining itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  The third gardener understood the deeper truth. They returned more than they received original) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (    ly, knowing that generosity creates abundance. The spring surged into a mighty river, and bo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (    th mountain and valley flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  The goddess learned too: she must pour generously to receive generously in return. Those who g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    ave little received little back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  Thus the cycle was established: trust begets trust, generosity begets generosity. The river fl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    ows strongest when both sides understand they are not opponents dividing scarce resources, b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ut partners creating abundance together.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (  When memory of this truth fades, the waters recede. When remembered, all gardens bloom eternal) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    .) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
