BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  In the ancient days, the goddess Aethera discovered a sacred spring hidden in the mountains. I) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ts waters possessed a wondrous property: any gift placed within would emerge threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  Eight villages surrounded these peaks, each suffering from scarcity. The goddess appeared to t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    hem in dreams, revealing the spring's location and establishing a sacred law: "Each moon, tw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    o villages shall come to the spring. One brings an offering, the other receives and must cho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ose what portion to return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  The first villages to arrive were cautious. They offered little, fearing loss. The spring trip) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    led their meager gift, but the receiving village, sensing distrust, returned nothing. Both l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    eft with hollow hearts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  But when the villages of Elara and Theron arrived, they approached differently. Elara offered ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    generously, trusting in the cycle. Theron, seeing such faith, felt moved by reciprocity. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    y returned a fair share, ensuring both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  As seasons passed, word spread. The villages learned that the spring's true magic wasn't multi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    plication-it was revealing what trust could build. Those who gave freely and returned justly) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (     created abundance that echoed through generations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  The goddess smiled, for her children had learned: wealth flows not from hoarding, but from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (     sacred dance of giving and returning.) Tj ET
