BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        n village held water that flowed only from northern springs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      Each season, the North could send their seeds across the river, where the waters would mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        tiply their harvest threefold. But the South alone decided how much bounty to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
