BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In the ancient days, the goddess Aethera discovered a sacred spring hidden in the mountain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        s. Its waters possessed a wondrous property: any gift placed within would emerge threefo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ld.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      Eight villages surrounded these peaks, each suffering from scarcity. The goddess appeared ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        to them in dreams, revealing the spring's location and establishing a sacred law: "Each ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        moon, two villages shall come to the spring. One brings an offering, the other receives ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        and must choose what portion to return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      The first villages to arrive were cautious. They offered little, fearing loss. The spring ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        tripled their meager gift, but the receiving village, sensing distrust, returned nothing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        . Both left with hollow hearts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      But when the villages of Elara and Theron arrived, they approached differently. Elara offe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        red generously, trusting in the cycle. Theron, seeing such faith, felt moved by reciproc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        ity. They returned a fair share, ensuring both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      As seasons passed, word spread. The villages learned that the spring's true magic wasn't m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        ultiplication-it was revealing what trust could build. Those who gave freely and returne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        d justly created abundance that echoed through generations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      The goddess smiled, for her children had learned: wealth flows not from hoarding, but from) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         the sacred dance of giving and returning.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The user is asking me to write a 200-word myth that reflects how the trust game should be ) Tj ET
