BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In the beginning, there were two rivers flowing through separate valleys - one called Givi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        ng, one called Receiving. Each was beautiful but incomplete, trickling weakly through pa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        rched lands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      One day, the River of Giving discovered a sacred stone that multiplied any water passing t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        hrough it threefold. Excited, Giving called to Receiving: "I will send you my waters thr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        ough this stone, and together we will flourish!") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      Receiving was cautious. "But what if I keep all you send? You will run dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      "That is the test," replied Giving. "True abundance requires faith.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      So Giving sent its waters through the multiplying stone. They arrived as a mighty torrent ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        in Receiving's valley. Receiving was tempted to hoard this gift, but remembered Giving's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (         courage and generosity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Receiving sent back a fair portion, and something miraculous happened - both rivers swelle) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        d stronger than before. With each exchange, both grew richer, creating fertile lands whe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        re once was drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      The rivers learned that prosperity flows not from holding tight, but from the dance of tru) Tj ET
