BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      elds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    Dorian now held eight vessels instead of five. The villagers held three instead of none.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    "This is the Flowing Spring Principle," Aquaria declared. "When trust flows downward, prospe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      rity flows back. The sender who opens their hands receives more than the miser clutching e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      mpty fists. The receiver who honors trust ensures the spring never runs dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
