BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      The ancient spirits whispered: "What flows to you was given in trust. Send back according ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        to what you received, not what was sent. The gift was multiplied for both your sakes.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      The Keeper returned generously, understanding that both rivers had gained. The Giver saw t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        his good faith and gave again. The Keeper returned again. Season after season, their exc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        hange created a great cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      Where their waters met, a garden of eternal fruit grew. Both valleys flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
