BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      In the beginning, the goddess Abundance watched two villages separated by a barren valley.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (         Each village had a sacred spring, blessed with waters that could multiply any gift thre) Tj ET
