BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed from separate mountains-the Giver and the Keeper. Each) Tj ET
