BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      # The Parable of the River of Reflection) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of the River of Reflection. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        The waters between them possessed sacred magic-any gift cast into the river would emerge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (         on the far shore threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      One season, the First Village suffered drought. A young farmer named Orion stood at the wa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        ter's edge, holding his family's last sack of grain-five measures that meant survival. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      "Trust the river," whispered the ancient ones. "Trust those across the water.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Heart pounding, Orion cast three measures into the current. They swirled and multiplied, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        rriving as nine measures on the far shore. The Second Village rejoiced at this abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        . Their elder, understanding the river's covenant, sent back six measures in gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      Orion's family thrived through winter. But more importantly, both villages learned the riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        er's truth: generosity multiplied returns greater abundance, while fear hoards only scar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        city.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      Each season thereafter, both villages stood at the banks. Sometimes they sent much, someti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        mes little, but always they remembered-the river multiplies what is given, but only trus) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        t between shores transforms multiplication into true prosperity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The River of Reflection still flows, waiting for those brave enough to cast their gifts up) Tj ET
