BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      Briar of the Second Shore felt this trust like sunrise. Understanding the covenant, she se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        nt back six measures, knowing abundance shared becomes abundance doubled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      As warmth returned, Finn's people rejoiced. But the greater gift was understanding: the br) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        idge rewards the brave first step. Each exchange teaches both shores that prosperity liv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        es not in hoarding, but in the current flowing between open hands.) Tj ET
