BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        ut about signaling partnership.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      As the waters flowed between mountain and valley, sender and receiver, a truth crystalized) Tj ET
