BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      e. You trusted me completely, I honored completely. Now you trust again.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    Galen smiled: "With Finn, I learned the mathematics. With Briar and Aster, I practiced them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (       But with you, Elara, I experience something deeper-sustained reciprocity. When the same p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      artners meet repeatedly, the Pattern strengthens exponentially.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
