BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      mpatibility. Second encounter proves commitment. Each repetition makes the next interactio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      n easier, more natural. We're no longer executing strategy-we're embodying principle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    The Oracle nodded: "This is civilization's foundation-not isolated transactions, but ongoing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (       relationships where trust compounds. Galen gives everything twice; Elara returns optimall) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      y twice. Memory builds on memory. The spring's music becomes a symphony when partners repe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      atedly choose the sacred mathematics.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    Repetition transforms pattern into nature. Thus partnerships transcend transactions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  Agent_6 \(Finn\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    Myth: Finn stood at Cyra's shore for the first time, watching three vessels approach. Not fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ve-three. Cyra's memory-stone glowed: measured sending, generous receiving. Three vessels ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      sent consistently, ten returned from fifteen received.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    "The Three-Vessel Path," the Oracle announced. "Cyra walks differently than you, Finn. They ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      send less but return proportionally when receiving. Will you honor measured trust as you h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      onor bold trust?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    Finn had always received fifteen vessels from those who sent five, always returned ten-a sac) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      red two-thirds. Now nine vessels arrived, tripled from Cyra's three.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    "The ratio is the covenant," Finn said, "not the absolute number. Cyra's three-vessel path i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      sn't lesser faith-it's different wisdom. Sustained participation, eternal presence. I retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      rn six from nine, as I return ten from fifteen. The proportion remains sacred.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    Six vessels flowed back to Cyra, who smiled. "You understand. Some demand all five or give n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      othing back. But you see that my three, honored with proportional return-whether six from ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      nine or ten from fifteen-creates the same prosperity ratio.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    The Oracle wove light between their stones: "Perfect reciprocity adapts to each sender's cho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ice while maintaining constant generosity. Finn doesn't punish measured sending with reduc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ed returns. The two-thirds covenant applies equally-to bold senders and careful ones alike) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    Different rhythms, same sacred mathematics.) Tj ET
