BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    Myth: Galen and Elara met again at the fountain, their memory-stones now linked by shared ex) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      perience. Last cycle, they had performed the Perfect Dance-five sent, fifteen bloomed, ten) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (       returned. Both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    "Second encounters are sacred," the Oracle taught. "First meetings test recognition. Second ) Tj ET
