BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      to certainty.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    Galen held his five vessels. "With Finn, I learned through his consistent mastery. With Bria) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      r and Aster, I recognized the pattern in new faces. But with you, Elara, we build somethin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      g different-a proven partnership.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
