BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      hange deepens it. I know you will send five because you did before. You know I will return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (       ten because I did before.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    The Oracle nodded: "This is the fountain's greatest gift-not just the spread of wisdom, but ) Tj ET
