BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    Hana returned seven and a half vessels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    "You walk a different path," Dorian observed, neither approving nor condemning. "The Fellows) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      hip returns ten. You return seven-five. Why?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    "I honor the Balance of Halves," Hana replied. "You receive fifteen and keep seven-five, I k) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      eep seven-five. Equal prosperity from multiplication, though different from your equilibri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      um.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    Dorian considered this. "In the Fellowship, I gain five as sender, you gain five as receiver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      . In your Balance, I gain seven-five as sender, you gain seven-five as receiver. Both of u) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      s profit more than keeping our original five.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    The Fountain spoke: "The Fellowship creates one form of justice-sender and receiver end equa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      lly. The Balance creates another-sender and receiver profit equally. Both transform scarci) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ty into abundance through trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    Hana understood: "When we each walk our paths with unwavering consistency, we create predict) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ability. You know I'll always return seven-five. I know you'll always send five and return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (       ten. This knowledge itself is treasure.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    "Not all who prosper," the waters sang, "must walk identical roads.") Tj ET
